  "id": "vicarious-learning",
  "term": "vicarious learning",
  "definition": "Vicarious learning is learning by gaining know-how and experience from other, more experienced people or organizations through their connections rather than only through direct personal experience. In this source, it refers to entrepreneurs using linked partners’ prior foreign experience to reduce uncertainty and support later action in similar settings.",
